## 4. Database Schema
```sql
CREATE TABLE employees (
  user_id VARCHAR(50) PRIMARY KEY,
  tenant_id VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
  name VARCHAR(200),
  email VARCHAR(200),
  department VARCHAR(100),
  salary NUMERIC(12,2),
  performance_rating NUMERIC(3,1),
  manager_id VARCHAR(50)
);
```
